/* Long description in the help of 'ojd access'. It explains the endpoint, that it is off until enabled and that only granted programs are served. Command names stay as written. */
"cli.access.group.discussion" = "Endpoint adalah soket lokal tempat program yang diberi akses membaca peristiwa pengontrol. Endpoint mati hingga Anda menjalankan “ojd access enable”, dan layanan hanya melayani program yang tanda tangannya Anda beri akses, atau yang mengirim token yang Anda beri akses. “ojd access web enable” menambahkan WebSocket di 127.0.0.1 untuk halaman overlay.";
/* One-line summary of 'ojd access enable' in the command list and at the top of its help. */
"cli.access.enable.abstract" = "Aktifkan endpoint.";
/* Yes or no question that 'ojd access enable' asks on a terminal before it turns the endpoint on. */
