"error.E1004.message" = "Endpoint sudah melayani 8 koneksi per transport (soket dan WebSocket masing-masing). Tutup koneksi yang tidak Anda perlukan, dan hubungkan lagi.";
/* Text of error E1005, sent to an endpoint client whose grant is removed while it is connected. The command in quotes stays as written. */
"error.E1005.message" = "Akses klien ini dihapus saat terhubung. Beri akses lagi dengan “ojd access grant”, dan hubungkan lagi.";
/* Text of error E1006, sent to an endpoint client that reads lines too slowly, so that 256 lines wait for it. 256 is the fixed limit. */
"error.E1006.message" = "Klien membaca baris terlalu lambat, dan 256 baris menunggu. Baca baris secepat datangnya, dan hubungkan lagi.";
